<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:47Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>FedEx plane overshoots runway at Miami airport on Thanksgiving eve</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b6b6c3ca571038d3bdfcf5569cc0cc94825ff79e2d4793e5561eeb114fb5447c</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:14Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T08:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/fedex-plane-overshoots-runway-at-miami-airport-on-thanksgiving-eve/a-80056541--fa2371e3c0aa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/fedex-plane-overshoots-runway-at-miami-airport-on-thanksgiving-eve/a-80056541?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A FedEx plane from Memphis ran past the end of a runway at Miami airport, shutting most runways and causing delays of several hours on the eve of the US holiday.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>EU leaders seek agreement on long-term budget and Ukraine at summit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e7e09ec8a91b6b035af2e554af3dbaac5a2b634ffecf7e69cb16e49b4adf172e</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:17Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T07:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-leaders-seek-agreement-on-long-term-budget-and-ukraine-at-summit/live-80056415--9370b6a43809.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-leaders-seek-agreement-on-long-term-budget-and-ukraine-at-summit/live-80056415?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Leaders of the EU's 27 member states are expected to thrash out the EU's budget for 2028 to 2034. Ukraine and European Central Bank leadership are also up for discussion. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Resolve tariff concerns in trade talks — India tells US</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:922a0f9c7ff0474719f6160153b935430dccef22223e0b6377db68504f98211a</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T06:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-resolve-tariff-concerns-in-trade-talks-india-tells-us/live-80056202--8adafaf8404f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-resolve-tariff-concerns-in-trade-talks-india-tells-us/live-80056202?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">India has denied US claims that New Delhi's policies promote excess manufacturing capacity. Further headlines from India include Constitution Day celebrations. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How Chinese companies circumvent chips sanctions in Southeast Asia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:109d1cbd52879fa14a4be526b2dc0eada72ac05414d8c589f0742d136927f162</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:23Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T06:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-chinese-companies-circumvent-chips-sanctions-in-southeast-asia/a-80041002--ca78b0ef9d25.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-chinese-companies-circumvent-chips-sanctions-in-southeast-asia/a-80041002?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">High-tech AI chips are hard to get in China because of US restrictions. To get around this, Chinese companies often use offshore computing capacity, particularly in Southeast Asia. The US is also trying to stop it.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Can Rassvet, 'Russia's Starlink' change the course of the war in Ukraine?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:91fe6e9ffab8fad1acdb636be09f7386ab915622895daaf992fb6431ae010a29</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:26Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T05:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/can-rassvet-russia-s-starlink-change-the-course-of-the-war-in-ukraine/a-80052579--622ab8b1bc5d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/can-rassvet-russia-s-starlink-change-the-course-of-the-war-in-ukraine/a-80052579?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">SpaceX's US Starlink satellite system has played a key role in countering the Russian military in Ukraine, but now a Russian counterpart is under development. What could this mean for Ukraine in future?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>US court blocks regulator's early review of ABC's broadcast licenses</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:359eba759093b255c9dc4169c6933fbe1ea0bbce39fa9ac4a50fd50d6b17bf8c</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T04:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-court-blocks-regulator-s-early-review-of-abc-s-broadcast-licenses/a-80056181--b06bab972a9c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-court-blocks-regulator-s-early-review-of-abc-s-broadcast-licenses/a-80056181?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The FCC chairman had ordered an early review of ABC's licenses a day after President Donald Trump called for the broadcaster to fire Jimmy Kimmel earlier this year. The licenses were not set to expire until 2028.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Kim Jong Un tours nuclear material sites, urges wider use of tactical nuclear weapons</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:31ba66dd6a075af67371f020da02093f89c81fb5dd990c596dcc0ca8bd16895c</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:32Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T04:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/kim-jong-un-tours-nuclear-material-sites-urges-wider-use-of-tactical-nuclear-weapons/a-80055887--3e6bd65b24cc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/kim-jong-un-tours-nuclear-material-sites-urges-wider-use-of-tactical-nuclear-weapons/a-80055887?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">North Korea's Kim Jong Un visited sites that produce nuclear material and told his military to focus on tactical weapons, saying his country's nuclear status is irreversible.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Extreme weather threatens Thanksgiving festivities in US</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a82091fcec6b97a38bbdaa046afb19ef0084f37478c514c180d49ff5f1c8ec28</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:35Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T02:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/extreme-weather-threatens-thanksgiving-festivities-in-us/a-80055880--04519a33e0ed.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/extreme-weather-threatens-thanksgiving-festivities-in-us/a-80055880?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A major storm is forecast to move up the US East Coast and is likely to cause travel delays. Weather warnings were enough to postpone Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade for the first time in its 100 years.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Duran Duran guitarist Andy Taylor dies at 65</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7f2db3f492638936d438086ca86349de507b93fc7811a1f7d5047d6df34f87b3</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T22:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/duran-duran-guitarist-andy-taylor-dies-at-65/a-80055654--e1b7f742aed7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/duran-duran-guitarist-andy-taylor-dies-at-65/a-80055654?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Andy Taylor first revealed he was battling cancer in 2022 when Duran Duran was inducted into the Rock &amp;amp; Roll Hall of Fame. The band had numerous hits in the 1980s, including "Girls on Film" and "Hungry Like The Wolf."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Egypt: At least 31 dead after fuel truck overturns on highway</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1954163cf78052aded36bab710636acfbb926fac927092608876ee0d353dd44d</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:41Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T21:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/egypt-at-least-31-dead-after-fuel-truck-overturns-on-highway/a-80055175--08e39bb25efc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/egypt-at-least-31-dead-after-fuel-truck-overturns-on-highway/a-80055175?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The accident occurred on the packed Ring Road in Giza near Cairo. Dozens of ambulances responded to the crash, and Egyptian health authorities say the death toll could rise.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nigeria detains 5 Mexicans, confiscates over $220 million of meth</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:be2ae5608335bc42042e18e0b0ffe5a567dcfbe31ca00f859be56ae9db0babd6</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T20:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nigeria-detains-5-mexicans-confiscates-over-220-million-of-meth/a-80054606--ed6de81a9556.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-detains-5-mexicans-confiscates-over-220-million-of-meth/a-80054606?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Nigeria's anti-drug agency said Mexican experts were allegedly recruited by a Nigerian national to run a meth laboratory in the southeastern state of Enugu.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Peter Magyar meets Volodymyr Zelenskyy: Hungary and Ukraine make a fresh start after the icy relations of the Viktor Orban era</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:192773ef9f6cc111dc9b0dd245e812b138749b3f9be168ff8cddd449658b45da</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T18:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/peter-magyar-meets-volodymyr-zelenskyy-hungary-and-ukraine-make-a-fresh-start-after-the-icy-relation/a-80054175--5597adb6deec.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/peter-magyar-meets-volodymyr-zelenskyy-hungary-and-ukraine-make-a-fresh-start-after-the-icy-relations-of-the-viktor-orban-era/a-80054175?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After years of frosty and hostile relations under Hungary's Kremlin-friendly former PM Viktor Orban, his successor, Peter Magyar, and Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy seek to reset their countries' ties.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Spain: Canary Islands witness 1-day migration record</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5ecffe0e9074652e2ce4d6ce4fe34a6f81c92c869740cf87b3c8e3b7ee0f22c4</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T18:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/spain-canary-islands-witness-1-day-migration-record/a-80052770--8a7d7af8fd05.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/spain-canary-islands-witness-1-day-migration-record/a-80052770?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The arrival of over 2,000 migrants to the islands comes as Spain holds elections this weekend. The president of the Canary Islands said the archipelago is facing "unprecedented migration pressure."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>€561 Billion and Still Not Enough: Germany's 2027 Budget Exposes a Coalition on the Brink</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:694cf0c68aeeaf9d76f5f01bcd4562d92978c898f7e32f9c9a38c2b937d8235a</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T16:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/561-billion-and-still-not-enough-germany-s-2027-budget-exposes-a-coalition-on-the-brink/a-80052664--c8b0f8b87743.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/€561-billion-and-still-not-enough-germany-s-2027-budget-exposes-a-coalition-on-the-brink/a-80052664?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The budget for 2027 has reached new highs, and pension funds, defense spending and a weak economy are increasing the pressure. At the same time, tensions are mounting within the government.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>US Army detonates unstable lead-based explosives in Iowa</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d8b62ba9bc9ca9b622e3080fc4f38d18241f32a3948d283da1a959bcdf467b15</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T15:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-army-detonates-unstable-lead-based-explosives-in-iowa/a-80043319--c4804e3d6ed1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-army-detonates-unstable-lead-based-explosives-in-iowa/a-80043319?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US Army says a controlled blast is the safest way to deal with explosive chemicals that began crystallizing in storage. US President Donald Trump said "mitigation efforts have far exceeded expectations."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>EU must set out a new timeline for cage-free farming, court rules</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ceb8fde18d3732881331a6527af559ed4a71d32dc16fdbafd79f73976fe1e962</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T15:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-must-set-out-a-new-timeline-for-cage-free-farming-court-rules/a-80051729--5055be48cf6e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-must-set-out-a-new-timeline-for-cage-free-farming-court-rules/a-80051729?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">European General Court ruled that the European Commission has failed to set out a timeline after pledging to end caged farming by the end of 2023.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nigeria's upcoming election marred by rising AI disinformation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:73e115da96d191261040ede358e24d0ac0a2822b7f378ed5b8ac5c2e88fdf873</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T15:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nigeria-s-upcoming-election-marred-by-rising-ai-disinformation/a-79946897--e1618bd315dd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-s-upcoming-election-marred-by-rising-ai-disinformation/a-79946897?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As Nigeria inches closer to the 2027 polls, the use of artificial intelligence in the electoral process has prompted questions about integrity and institutional readiness. Can Nigerians trust their democratic processes?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine: Poland to set up no-fly zone near Ukraine border</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c0941931dd4f24fa5da22aea2b4eb10d2a4a6776b8aae99fddddf666934ae50b</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T14:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-poland-to-set-up-no-fly-zone-near-ukraine-border/live-80047122--a9b171e10de2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-poland-to-set-up-no-fly-zone-near-ukraine-border/live-80047122?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Poland urged NATO allies to be vigilant at their borders after repeated Russian airspace incursions. Allies have also offered different opinions on Kyiv attacking Russian ships in Libya.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US plans new tariffs on EU, China and 12 others</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:992da0c250b8eaf6e2d4e4ba5df262a5cb67a565f2f9e5997fb0fff13d4d94c1</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T14:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-plans-new-tariffs-on-eu-china-and-12-others/a-80050872--4aaf71a33ac8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-plans-new-tariffs-on-eu-china-and-12-others/a-80050872?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Trump administration is planning new import duties of up to 20% to counter excessive manufacturing abroad. The measures could put further pressure on US consumers already struggling with high living costs.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>German firms eye Africa as global trade shocks hit traditional markets</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:06be48e2566e622a3005236c9a73937f10d94a5b26a3a0c53f0b1bb142317147</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T14:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-firms-eye-africa-as-global-trade-shocks-hit-traditional-markets/a-80047671--b64160bb0ab9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-firms-eye-africa-as-global-trade-shocks-hit-traditional-markets/a-80047671?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">German businesses are optimistic about Africa, but Berlin's cautious approach to risk is holding them back from cashing in on the opportunities that their competitors from countries like the UAE and Turkey are seizing.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>EU plans €50 billion sovereign tech equity fund to boost quantum technology</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:14b5a2277031cef1de0b12fe6ac36a2d88060ad99765cefe9e14310c15b799f7</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T13:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-plans-_50-billion-sovereign-tech-equity-fund-to-boost-quantum-technology/a-80047569--2429dd24f928.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-plans-€50-billion-sovereign-tech-equity-fund-to-boost-quantum-technology/a-80047569?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The European Commission proposed a tech fund with a target size of €50 billion to boost quantum computing efforts. The bloc aims to keep up with the US and China in the global race.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
